flowchart TB
    U[사용자]
    FE[Frontend]
    BE[Backend]
    MC[MCP Client Agent]
    DART[OpenDART]
    EMB[OpenAI Embeddings<br/>text-embedding-3-small]

    subgraph BDB[Backend PostgreSQL]
        USERS[(users)]
        PROFILES[(user_profiles)]
        RUNS[(analysis_runs)]
        RAG[(rag_chunks<br/>공용 벡터 DDL)]
    end

    subgraph CACHE[Redis DB 0]
        SHORT[(backend:short_term:user_id<br/>JSON + TTL 1800초)]
    end

    subgraph DDB[Disclosure MCP 전용 PostgreSQL]
        COMPANIES[(companies)]
        DISCLOSURES[(disclosures)]
        REPORTS[(annual_reports)]
        CHUNKS[(report_chunks<br/>vector 1536)]
    end

    U -->|회원가입·로그인| FE
    FE --> BE
    BE -->|가입 트랜잭션| USERS
    BE -->|장기 투자 성향| PROFILES
    USERS -->|PK/FK 1:0..1| PROFILES

    U -->|종목 분석| FE
    FE -->|분석 요청| BE
    BE -->|회원 최근 검색 상태| SHORT
    BE -->|공통 분석 요청| MC
    MC -->|공시·보고서 도구| COMPANIES

    COMPANIES -->|지원 종목·corp_code 확인| DART
    DART -->|최근 공시 목록| DISCLOSURES
    DART -->|정기보고서 XML| REPORTS
    REPORTS -->|파싱·청킹할 본문| EMB
    EMB -->|1536차원 벡터| CHUNKS
    REPORTS -->|ON DELETE CASCADE| CHUNKS

    MC -->|기업·종류·연도 SQL 선필터| REPORTS
    REPORTS -->|annual_report_id 범위| CHUNKS
    CHUNKS -->|cosine distance 정렬·top-k| MC
    MC -->|가격·뉴스·공시·커뮤니티 통합 결과| BE
    BE -->|요청·출처·실패·개인화 스냅샷| RUNS
    BE -->|응답| FE
    FE --> U

    MC -. "현재 직접 접근 코드 없음" .-> RAG
